<Layout title="Contact Preview My Post" description="Contact Preview My Post about product feedback, privacy, preview accuracy, accessibility, or business questions.">
	<article class="legal-page"><span class="eyebrow">Contact</span><h1>Let’s Make the Preview Better</h1><p class="lead">Report a layout change, accessibility issue, browser problem, or share product feedback.</p>
	<div class="contact-card"><div><h2 style="margin-top:0">Email</h2><p style="margin-bottom:0">Include your browser and affected preview placement. Do not attach confidential creative unless you choose to.</p></div><a class="button button-dark" href="mailto:hello@previewmypost.com">hello@previewmypost.com</a></div>
	<h2>Useful Details</h2><p>For a technical report, include the page URL, device type, browser version, preview mode, and a description of what you expected. Never send account passwords or Instagram login details—we do not need them.</p></article>
</Layout>
